{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08024","headline":"日出行 · 李白","name":"日出行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日出东方隈，似从地底来。\n历天又入海，六龙所舍安在哉？\n其始与终古不息，人非元气安得与之久裴徊。\n草不谢荣於春风，木不怨落於秋天。\n谁挥鞭策驱四运，万物兴歇皆自然。\n羲和羲和，汝奚汨没於荒淫之波。\n鲁阳何德，驻景挥戈。\n逆道违天，矫诬实多。\n吾将囊括大块，浩然与溟涬同科。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08024.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08024","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}